:''This enemy's official name is unknown.''
'''8th Anniversary Birthday Cake''' is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy that appears in [[Anniversary|B-Day Gifts]]. It was added in [[Version 10.0 Update|Version 10.0]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = 8th Anniversary Birthday Cake
|image = E 533.png
|appearance = [[8 Years of Fun!]]
|money drop = 7¢ ~ 27¢
}}

==Enemy==
This enemy appears to be four [[Doge]]s carrying a large birthday cake that stands on a can of Cat Food. At the top, there is a red and gold colored ribbon. The Doges remain hidden under the can but can be seen during its attack animation. Although it may not look like one, it is actually a Metal enemy.

==Strategy==
[[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Cow Cat]] and any other fast attacking characters such as [[Mr. (Special Cat)|Mr.]] can kill this enemy very easily. It deals pretty much no damage per hit, so there's no need to worry about it at all.

==Encounters==
